      *---  BUFFER FOR RESTRICTED WITHDRAWAL TABLE                      DRESTRIC
       01  BUF-DRESTRIC.                                                DRESTRIC
           05  RES-CORP-CODE           PIC X(9).                        DRESTRIC
           05  RES-RESTRICT-BY-CLASS REDEFINES RES-CORP-CODE.           DRESTRIC
               10  RES-RESTRICT-CLASS  PIC X(4).                        DRESTRIC
               10  FILLER              PIC X(3).                        DRESTRIC
           05  RES-RESTRICT-TYPE       PIC X.                           DRESTRIC
           05  RES-RESTRICT-TABLE.                                      DRESTRIC
               10 RES-DESC-LINE               OCCURS 45 TIMES           DRESTRIC
                                               INDEXED BY L-INDEX.      DRESTRIC
                  15 RES-DESC-BYTE     PIC X.                           DRESTRIC
                  15 RES-LINE-DATA     PIC X(4) OCCURS 10 TIMES         DRESTRIC
                                                  INDEXED BY D-INDEX.   DRESTRIC
                                                                        DRESTRIC
